  "title": "Pause Before Calling It New",
  "description": "When noticing a \"new\" trend: - Research its history: Check if this has actually been around for a while. - Ask others: See if someone older or more experienced recognizes it as old news. - Separate novelty from attention: Just because you noticed it recently doesn’t mean it’s new. Example: A \"new\" slang word? Look it up in older dictionaries or forums to see its origins.",
